# Pycrypt — Kryptos face menu (Pharos PMenuBar plain-text format)

# File
New | clear working and change text
Open | load a .txt message into Working Text
Save | write Change Text (or Working Text) to a file
Exit | close the face
---

# Cipher
Strip Characters | reduce to a clean letter stream
Rail Fence | zig-zag transposition
Scytale | rod-diameter transposition
Caesar | c = (p + k) mod 26  — 25 keys
Affine | c = (a*p + b) mod 26  — a coprime to 26
Pigpen | grid-fragment substitution (font)
Monoalphabetic | any rearrangement of the alphabet — 26! keys
Playfair | 5x5 keyed digraph cipher
Vigenere | repeating-key Caesar
Enigma | 3-rotor scrambler + plugboard
---

# Analysis
Frequency Analysis | letter-frequency bar chart (al-Kindi)
Digraph Frequency | letter-pair counts (breaks Playfair)
Hints | repeated letters, short words, e-h asymmetry
Vowel Trowel | Sukhotin's algorithm — locate the vowels
Break Caesar | try all 25 shifts, rank by English fit
Break Affine | try all 312 keys, rank by chi-squared
Break Vigenere | Kasiski + Index of Coincidence -> keyword
Word-Pattern Attack | match cipher words to a dictionary by pattern
English Reference | overlay the standard English distribution
---

# Enigma
Open Path Visualiser | watch the current flow through the rotors
Strength of Enigma | key-space counting (rotor order, positions, plugboard)
Rotor Set | Wehrmacht Enigma I  /  The Code Book CD-ROM
---

